WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.880
Okay,

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.480
we are coming out of executive session at 07:50PM

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.520
on Monday,

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.040
July 25.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.360
And we have no

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.040
pressing business.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.760
So if someone would like to make the last motion of the day, that would be great.

00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:20.295
I make a motion that we end this meeting at 07:49.

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:22.215
All right. Second.

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:29.501
Seconded by Scott Person. All those in favor? Aye. Thank you very much. Have a nice day. Jeff, good afternoon.

00:00:30.221 --> 00:00:34.061
Luck on the golf, Jeff. That's right. See you later. Thank you. Bye.
